    "                <span class=\"tok-n\">description</span><span class=\"tok-o\">=</span><span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-s2\">It gives you the value/price of Bitcoin on the market, in real time. </span><span class=\"tok-s2\">&quot;</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span>",
